{"ts":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"87347b071d1305e7d9cbbd27","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ygerpy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-802: persist structured numeric measurements with test runs"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Linked verification records whether a run passed but cannot persist what it measured, forcing coverage, latency, bundle-size, error-budget, and duplication values into unqueryable prose."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","area:sdk","context-management","gh-issue","linked-tests","metrics","queryability"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Test-run records accept typed numeric measurements with a name, value, optional unit, optional threshold, and timestamp without requiring an extension; Measurements remain bound to the producing run and accumulate as a bounded deterministic series rather than overwriting prior evidence; CLI, SDK, MCP, schemas, contracts, storage normalization, migrations, and public types expose the same measurement model; Read surfaces can filter and aggregate measurements, including a metric-below query and a latest-versus-previous diff; Focused, integration, acceptance, compatibility, and exact 100 percent coverage gates prove persistence and query behavior"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make quantitative verification evidence a first-class queryable SDK primitive"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Agents and fleet operators can compare quality evidence without parsing prose"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Adds a universal numeric evidence series usable by any project domain while retaining bounded item storage"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Quality, performance, reliability, and size measurements are durable, attributable, and queryable across items"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"GH-802 documents 18 package baselines currently stranded in prose despite test-result tracking being enabled"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-lm0j"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Enable test-result-tracking, run a linked verification that emits a coverage or latency value, inspect the persisted item, then attempt to filter items by that value."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A test run can carry structured numeric evidence that list, aggregate, and diff surfaces can query."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Current test_runs store status and counts only; measured baselines must be embedded in prose."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.7.29"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk-test-result-model"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Fleet-wide quality baselines cannot currently drive prioritization or trend analysis through pm."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-16f4","kind":"related_to","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-feecbs","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-i2pc","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: all-status searches for test result tracking, structured measurements, numeric metrics, quality metrics, and test_runs found the shipped pm-lm0j/pm-16f4/pm-i2pc persistence lineage but no item owning typed numeric evidence, series retention, metric filters, or diffs. GH-802 is therefore a new extension of that canonical lineage: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/802."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"058fc7828238aa7198493795f5d53b3dc1d3e93a0da91a54174103615889c157","message":"Track GH-802 structured verification measurements"}
